  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=850708), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14162094)\n\nThe contract killing organization \"Noden Company\". Kim Eun-Ho is a rookie police officer who infiltrates the organization. He survives by a stroke of luck, becoming the direct subordinate of the organization’s ace killer, Tae-Yi. Lee Tae-Yi recognizes Kim Eun-Ho’s hidden talent and begins training him to become a killer. The two, who were polar opposites, gradually become like brothers, but Kim Eun-Ho begins to lose his identity caught between being a police officer and a killer...",
